{"ts": 0.077336, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mWhat is here\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mls\u001b[0m lists the names in the folder you are standing in.\r\n", "len": 91}
{"ts": 0.077368, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m            \u001b[90m# the names\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls -p\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# the same, with / after each folder\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls -a\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# also the hidden names, which start with a dot\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls /\u001b[0m          \u001b[90m# a folder you are not in: the top of everything\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nNotice stage1/ in the second listing: the slash means a folder you\r\ncould step into.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Try all four, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 434}
