{"ts": 0.138995, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mHome and back\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nEvery user has a home folder. \u001b[1m~\u001b[0m is its short name.\r\n", "len": 88}
{"ts": 0.13902, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  \u001b[92mcd\u001b[0m                 \u001b[90m# with nothing after it: go home\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m                \u001b[90m# home is outside your practice folder\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcd /var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-4gxxk01y\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThe last line uses your practice folder's full name. A full name works\r\nfrom anywhere.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Go home and come back, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 404}
