{"ts": 0.238591, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[91mnot quite.\u001b[0m \u001b[90mhint:\u001b[0m Lesson 2.3: the two dots are the name of one particular other folder.\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 134}
