{"ts": 0.253002, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m Type \u001b[92mquit\u001b[0m to leave now; the next run starts this stage from its first lesson.\r\n\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m Type \u001b[92mshow\u001b[0m to see the question again.\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 176}
